      "message": "The derive macro wouldn\u0027t automatically solve the problem. Response, for ex, contains the ERROR_OK as the first element of the cbor array, which is not part of struct. We will need to use a combination of manual trait impl \u0026 macro. Secretkeeper error enum would also need some custom serialization. \n\nAn enum based approach that can best utilize the macro approach will be drastic code refactoring (including cddl changed). \n\nHave a look at the current state of this file at aosp/2855618.",
